  "remainingCompatibility": [
    "Long flag, decomposed Hangul and ZWJ prompts; long decomposed Hangul command text via text input/paste.",
    "A calibrated zsh (ml:20::x:) padding probe reports width 4 for flag and decomposed Hangul; xterm Unicode11 uses total width 2. This is a measured shell/terminal width disagreement, not proof that every remaining artifact has the same cause.",
